WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.293 --> 00:00:03.003
When you look
at every little detail

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:04.087
in The Dark Crystal,

00:00:05.297 --> 00:00:08.008
those things are
the apex of somebody's art.

00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:10.844
There's so few people
that know

00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:12.179
how we did it the first time,

00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:14.014 line:0%
and we're so old we don't&nbsp;
remember how we did it.

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:18.810
Everything is hand-sculpted,&nbsp;
hand-painted.

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:21.021
Just an amazing amount
of craftsmanship

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:23.148 line:0%
that you see
across the whole image.

00:00:25.526 --> 00:00:27.236
The first thing
you're trying to do

00:00:27.319 --> 00:00:29.696
is live up&nbsp;to&nbsp;
what the film produced.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:32.741 line:0%
The next stage&nbsp;
is then to push it a lot&nbsp;further.

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:35.827 line:0%
I think Jim Henson
would have been delighted.

00:00:37.371 --> 00:00:39.164 line:0%
Puppetry.
It's an art form in itself.

00:00:39.248 --> 00:00:40.582 line:0%
And that's
what you're watching.

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:43.544
I feel like Louis,&nbsp;
he's really the right person

00:00:43.627 --> 00:00:45.629
to be standing
in my father's shoes.

00:00:46.672 --> 00:00:48.465
The idea&nbsp;is that&nbsp;
you watch the show

00:00:48.549 --> 00:00:50.300 line:0%
and you forget
you're watching puppets.

00:01:41.018 --> 00:01:43.770
Your destiny calls to you.

